# Auth and secrets

- Hosted auth is Office Dialog + Supabase PKCE (`auth.html`), not Office SSO.
- Access token: memory only. Refresh token: add-in-origin `localStorage` (`hakichain.refreshToken`), try/catch. Refresh is single-flight because Supabase rotates.
- Dialog talks to the pane via `messageParent` strings. Do not rely on shared `localStorage` between dialog and pane.
- Org id (`src/lib/org.ts`) is sent as `X-Organization-ID`. Trusted org is still JWT-derived on the server. Roles: `owner` | `member` only.
- `Office.Settings` is forbidden for tokens, keys, and PII (it serializes into the .docx).
- `service_role` never belongs in `src/config.ts`, root `.env`, or pane Docker build args.
